sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Frontend
    participant API as RaceHub.API
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant RW as RankingWorker
    participant REW as RewardWorker
    participant SW as StatisticsWorker
    participant AW as AchievementsWorker
    participant Relay as Notification Relay
    participant SignalR as SignalR

    Client->>API: POST /api/races/{id}/finish
    API->>DB: Update race status → Finished
    API->>MQ: Publish RaceFinishedIntegrationEvent<br/>(routing key: race.finished)
    API-->>Client: 200 OK (immediate response)

    par Parallel Worker Processing
        MQ->>RW: Deliver to ranking-queue
        RW->>RW: Check idempotency (ProcessedMessage)
        RW->>DB: Update PlayerStatistics ratings
        RW->>MQ: ACK message
        RW-->>MQ: Mark as processed

        MQ->>REW: Deliver to reward-queue
        REW->>REW: Check idempotency (ProcessedMessage)
        REW->>DB: Award coins/XP via RewardCurve
        REW->>DB: Detect level-up, create Notification
        REW->>MQ: Publish reward.credited event
        REW->>MQ: ACK message
        REW-->>MQ: Mark as processed

        MQ->>SW: Deliver to statistics-queue
        SW->>SW: Check idempotency (ProcessedMessage)
        SW->>DB: Insert RaceHistoryEntry for each finisher
        SW->>MQ: ACK message
        SW-->>MQ: Mark as processed

        MQ->>AW: Deliver to achievements-queue
        AW->>AW: Check idempotency (ProcessedMessage)
        AW->>DB: Evaluate achievement criteria
        AW->>DB: Unlock achievements, create Notifications
        AW->>MQ: Publish achievement.unlocked event
        AW->>MQ: ACK message
        AW-->>MQ: Mark as processed
    end

    MQ->>Relay: Deliver reward.credited to reward-notify-queue
    Relay->>Relay: Check idempotency (ProcessedMessage)
    Relay->>SignalR: Push SignalR toast to connected clients
    Relay->>MQ: ACK message
    Relay-->>MQ: Mark as processed

    MQ->>Relay: Deliver achievement.unlocked to achievement-notify-queue
    Relay->>Relay: Check idempotency (ProcessedMessage)
    Relay->>SignalR: Push SignalR toast to connected clients
    Relay->>MQ: ACK message
    Relay-->>MQ: Mark as processed

    SignalR->>Client: Live reward toast notification
    SignalR->>Client: Live achievement toast notification
